--- task
id: m1
dataset: section8
kind: block as a value (count plus projection)
answer: fewest
composition: count plus projection

--- intent
For every person, return their name and how many people they know as `degree` (zero for people who know nobody), most connected first.

--- edition3
query degrees() {
  match {
    $p: Person
    let $degree = count { $p knows $q }
  }
  return { $p.name, $degree }
  order { $degree desc }
}
